### 6. 🟡 MEDIUM — Circular Import Pattern in Scheduler

**Location:** [`scheduler.py`](file:///H:/Projects/Order%20Supervisor%20(POC)/backend/app/scheduler.py#L100), [`events.py`](file:///H:/Projects/Order%20Supervisor%20(POC)/backend/app/api/events.py#L186)

Imports like `from app.agent.runtime import run_agent` are deferred inside function bodies to avoid circular imports. This is a symptom of a circular dependency between `scheduler → runtime → scheduler`. The fix is proper dependency inversion.

